OL,3,GNEWSASevere drought declared in parts
OL,4,Aof southern England
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said customer supplies
OL,7,Fwould be uninterrupted and declaring
OL,8,Fsevere drought "ensures proactive steps
OL,9,Fare taken to safeguard water before any
OL,10,Fdisruption occurs".
